            "review_title": "Review at Mía Dining",
            "review_text": "Edinburgh2014\nEdinburgh, United Kingdom22 contributions\n0\nOutstanding Dining in HCMC!\nMay 2024 • Couples\nThis was an absolutely outstanding Dinner and food! Such an amazing space, open Kitchen, fantastic staff and lovely ambience. Value for money for that quality of food was exceptional. This is a hidden gem in Ho Chi Min City. They have a cocktail bar above but we did not have a drink in that bar but had a cocktail from there at the table and they were also amazing so next time we are in HCMC we will definitely try the cocktail bar and definitely the restaurant again! Thanks to all the staff as this was exceptional.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGo forma cocktail before in the bar\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2024",
