            "review_text": "ngoctrantran\nSan Jose, California315 contributions\n0\nBest Breast.\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nMy husband insists it serves the best duck, so we found ourselves returning three times within our three weeks in Saigon to confirm his claims. Mía Dining offers three different Prix Fixe Menus, and I've tried all three. While the beef and pork were both excellent, the duck still tops them all. I'm pleased to hear that Mía changes its Prix Fixe menu according to the seasons and availability of fresh ingredients but still keeps the duck breast.\nRead more\nWritten March 1, 2024",
